/* VIP 尊荣流光扫光动效 (与替烟艺术展柜完全一致的 10s 高奢金芒流光 - 全局绝对同频同步机制) */
.vip-noble-nameplate::after,
.hero-vip-badge::after {
  content: '';
  position: absolute;
  top: -50%;
  left: -80%;
  width: 50%;
  height: 200%;
  background: linear-gradient(
    90deg,
    transparent 0%,
    transparent 46%,
    rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.30) 49%,
    rgba(254, 240, 138, 0.85) 50%,
    rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.30) 51%,
    transparent 54%,
    transparent 100%
  );
  transform: rotate(12deg);
  opacity: 0;
  will-change: transform, opacity;
  animation-duration: 10s;
  animation-iteration-count: infinite;
  animation-timing-function: cubic-bezier(0.25, 1, 0.5, 1);
  animation-name: vipSweepLightA;
  pointer-events: none;
  z-index: 2;
}

.vip-sweep-phase-a .vip-noble-nameplate::after,
.vip-sweep-phase-a .hero-vip-badge::after {
  animation-name: vipSweepLightA;
}

.vip-sweep-phase-b .vip-noble-nameplate::after,
.vip-sweep-phase-b .hero-vip-badge::after {
  animation-name: vipSweepLightB;
}

@keyframes vipSweepLightA {
  0%, 35% {
    transform: translateX(0) rotate(12deg);
    opacity: 0;
  }
  40% {
    opacity: 1;
  }
  68% {
    transform: translateX(380%) rotate(12deg);
    opacity: 1;
  }
  74%, 100% {
    transform: translateX(380%) rotate(12deg);
    opacity: 0;
  }
}

@keyframes vipSweepLightB {
  0%, 35% {
    transform: translateX(0) rotate(12deg);
    opacity: 0;
  }
  40% {
    opacity: 1;
  }
  68% {
    transform: translateX(380%) rotate(12deg);
    opacity: 1;
  }
  74%, 100% {
    transform: translateX(380%) rotate(12deg);
    opacity: 0;
  }
}

